{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51205","headline":"五言白话诗 十二 · 缺名","name":"五言白话诗 十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"本是达官儿，名作郎君子。\n从小好读书，更须多识字。\n长大人中官，当衙判曹事。\n高马衣轻裘，伴涉诸王子。\n官高渐入朝，供奉亲天子。\n纵得公王侯，终归不免死。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"缺名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51205.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51205","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}